A command suite to manipulate ec2 instances.

CAVEAT: Currently hardcoded to a particular
aws user profile called 'showme'.

INSTALLATION:
    Run ./install.sh from this directory.  It will
    create symlink

        ${HOME}/.local/bin/my-aws -> ./bin/my-aws

